<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>أكاديمية فيض</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=El+Messiri:wght@500;600;700&family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#20302a; --paper:#f9f1df; --card:#fffdf7;
    --emerald:#0d3d33; --emerald-2:#1f6350; --mint:#e5efe8;
    --sage-soft:#d7e6dc;
    --gold:#a9823f; --gold-soft:#f1e3c3; --gold-deep:#84632b;
    --warm:#f2e7cc;
    --line:rgba(13,61,51,0.16);
    --shadow: 0 18px 38px -22px rgba(13,61,51,0.32);
    box-sizing:border-box;
    padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
    padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  }
  *{box-sizing:inherit;}
  html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px); scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  html,body{height:100%;}
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif; line-height:1.7; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:'El Messiri',sans-serif; margin:0; font-weight:700;}
  p{margin:0;}
  .wrap{max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){
    .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(18px); transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;}
    .reveal.in-view{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}
    .blob{animation:float 9s ease-in-out infinite;}
    .blob.b2{animation-duration:11s; animation-delay:-3s;}
    @keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) scale(1);} 50%{transform:translateY(-18px) scale(1.05);}}
  }

  .topbar{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:20; top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
    background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 86%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .topbar .wrap{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; min-height:60px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; row-gap:6px; padding-top:8px; padding-bottom:8px;}
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'El Messiri'; font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--emerald-2); min-width:0;}
  .brand-mark{flex:none; width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50% 50% 50% 4px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--emerald),var(--gold-deep)); color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:.95rem;}
  .brand-text{overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;}
  .topbar .cta-btn{flex:none;}
  .cta-btn{
    background:var(--emerald); color:#fff; border:none; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:100px;
    font-family:'Tajawal'; font-weight:700; font-size:.9rem; cursor:pointer; text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-block; transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, background .25s ease;
    box-shadow:0 10px 22px -12px rgba(15,61,46,.6);
  }
  .cta-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px); background:var(--emerald-2);}
  .cta-btn.ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--emerald-2); border:1.5px solid var(--emerald-2); box-shadow:none;}
  .cta-btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--mint);}
  .cta-btn.accent{background:var(--gold-deep); box-shadow:0 10px 22px -12px rgba(143,108,47,.5);}
  .cta-btn.accent:hover{background:#7a5c28;}
  .cta-btn.sm{padding:7px 16px; font-size:.82rem;}
  @media (max-width:480px){
    .cta-btn{font-size:.85rem; padding:9px 16px;}
    .topbar .brand{font-size:1rem;}
    .topbar .brand-mark{width:28px; height:28px; font-size:.85rem;}
    .topbar .cta-btn{padding:8px 14px; font-size:.78rem;}
  }
  @media (max-width:360px){
    .plan .prices div{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:2px;}
    .letter{margin:0 8px;}
  }
  .link-btn{color:var(--gold-deep); font-weight:700; font-size:.85rem; text-decoration:underline; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; font-family:'Tajawal'; padding:0;}

  .hero{position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding:64px 0 80px;}
  .arch{position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0;}
  .blob{position:absolute; border-radius:50%; filter:blur(clamp(22px,5vw,44px)); opacity:.5;}
  .blob.b1{width:min(300px,50vw); height:min(300px,50vw); background:var(--gold-soft); top:-15%; right:-12%; opacity:.55;}
  .blob.b2{width:min(260px,45vw); height:min(260px,45vw); background:var(--sage-soft); bottom:-15%; left:-12%; opacity:.6;}
  .hero .wrap{position:relative; z-index:1; text-align:center;}
  .eyebrow{color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; font-size:.9rem;}
  .eyebrow-frame{position:relative; display:inline-block; padding:14px 30px; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .eyebrow-frame svg{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; z-index:0; pointer-events:none;}
  .eyebrow-frame .eyebrow{position:relative; z-index:1; margin-bottom:0;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem); color:var(--emerald); line-height:1.4;}
  .hero h1 .accent{color:var(--gold-deep);}
  .hero p.lead{max-width:560px; margin:18px auto 0; font-size:1.05rem; opacity:.85;}
  .hero-actions{display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; margin-top:28px; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  section{padding:56px 0;}
  section.mini{padding:34px 0;}
  .section-head{text-align:center; max-width:600px; margin:0 auto 34px;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3vw,1.95rem); color:var(--emerald);}
  .section-head p{margin-top:10px; opacity:.8; font-size:1rem;}

  .grid3{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;}
  .offer-card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; padding:26px 24px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow); transition:transform .3s ease; border-top:4px solid var(--accent,var(--gold));
  }
  .offer-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);}
  .offer-card .ic{width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:12px; background:var(--accent-soft,var(--gold-soft)); color:var(--accent,var(--gold)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .offer-card h3{font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--emerald-2); margin-bottom:6px;}
  .offer-card p{opacity:.82; font-size:.95rem;}
  .offer-card .sub-links{margin-top:10px; display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .why{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--emerald),#0b2a20); color:#fff;}
  .why .section-head h2{color:#fff;}
  .why .section-head p{color:var(--gold-soft); opacity:1;}
  .rowlist{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px;}
  .why-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px 24px; max-width:680px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;}
  .why-list li{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:.98rem; color:#fff; opacity:.92;}
  .why-list li:before{content:"✓"; flex:none; color:var(--gold-soft); font-weight:700; background:rgba(255,255,255,.14); width:22px; height:22px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:.78rem;}

  .offers-teaser{background:var(--warm);}
  .teaser-card{max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--card); border:2px solid var(--gold); border-radius:20px; padding:26px 24px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
  .teaser-title{font-family:'El Messiri'; font-size:1.25rem; color:var(--gold-deep); margin-bottom:14px;}
  .teaser-list{list-style:none; margin:0 0 18px; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px; text-align:right;}
  .teaser-list li{font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink); opacity:.9; position:relative; padding-right:22px;}
  .teaser-list li:before{content:"✓"; position:absolute; right:0; color:var(--gold-deep); font-weight:700;}
  .rowlist .item{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius:16px; padding:20px 22px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); transition:transform .3s ease;}
  .rowlist .item:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);}
  .rowlist .item h3{color:var(--gold-soft); font-size:1.02rem; margin-bottom:5px;}
  .rowlist .item p{opacity:.85; font-size:.92rem;}

  .audience{background:var(--warm); text-align:center;}
  .audience-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:14px; margin-top:6px;}
  .audience-card{background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:18px 10px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
  .audience-card h3{font-size:.92rem; color:var(--emerald-2); margin-bottom:10px;}

  .offers{background:var(--card);}
  .offers-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px;}
  .offer-chip{background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-top:4px solid var(--gold); border-radius:18px; padding:24px 20px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); text-decoration:none; color:inherit; display:block; transition:transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;}
  .offer-chip:hover{transform:translateY(-7px);}
  .offer-chip-title{font-weight:700; color:var(--gold-deep); margin-bottom:8px; font-size:1.05rem;}
  .offer-chip p{font-size:.9rem; opacity:.85;}
  .offer-chip .chip-cta{display:inline-block; margin-top:16px; font-size:.82rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; background:var(--gold-deep); padding:8px 18px; border-radius:100px;}

  .flex-time{background:var(--card);}
  .flex-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px;}
  .flex-card{background:var(--warm); border-radius:16px; padding:20px 18px;}
  .flex-card p{font-size:.9rem; opacity:.85;}
  .flex-card p.solution{margin-top:10px; color:var(--emerald-2); font-weight:700; opacity:1;}


  .split{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:34px; align-items:center;}
  .split .visual{aspect-ratio:3/4; max-width:290px; margin:0 auto; border-radius:22px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
  .split .visual img{width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;}

  .philosophy{background:var(--warm); text-align:center;}
  .philosophy blockquote{font-family:'El Messiri'; font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,1.6rem); color:var(--emerald); max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.6;}
  .philosophy .tip{display:inline-block; margin-top:20px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px; padding:12px 20px; font-size:.9rem; color:var(--gold-deep); font-weight:700;}

  .teachers .item{background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:var(--shadow); transition:transform .3s ease;}
  .teachers .item:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);}
  .teachers .item h3{color:var(--emerald-2);}
  .teachers .item p{opacity:.8;}

  .results{display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .results .pill{border-radius:100px; padding:10px 20px; font-weight:700; font-size:.9rem;}
  .pill.p1{background:var(--gold-soft); color:var(--gold-deep);}
  .pill.p2{background:var(--mint); color:var(--emerald-2);}
  .pill.p3{background:var(--warm); color:var(--gold-deep);}
  .pill.p4{background:var(--sage-soft); color:var(--emerald);}

  .letter{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--emerald),#0b2a20); color:#fff; border-radius:24px; padding:38px 32px; text-align:center; margin:0 24px;}
  .letter h2{color:var(--gold-soft); font-size:clamp(1.3rem,3vw,1.7rem);}
  .letter p{max-width:600px; margin:14px auto 0; opacity:.9;}
  .letter p.strong{color:var(--gold-soft); font-weight:700; opacity:1; margin-top:18px;}

  .follow-up{background:var(--mint); text-align:center;}
  .follow-up blockquote{font-family:'El Messiri'; font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2.4vw,1.3rem); color:var(--emerald); max-width:680px; margin:16px auto 0; line-height:1.7; font-weight:600;}
  .follow-up .motto{margin-top:18px; font-family:'El Messiri'; color:var(--gold-deep); font-size:1.05rem;}

  .mini-steps{text-align:center;}
  .mini-steps .flow{margin-top:6px; font-size:1.02rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--emerald-2); max-width:820px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; line-height:2;}
  .mini-steps .flow b{color:var(--gold-deep);}

  .availability{background:var(--mint); text-align:center;}
  .availability .countries{margin-top:12px; font-weight:700; color:var(--emerald-2); font-size:.98rem;}

  .plans-sub{font-weight:700; color:var(--gold-deep); text-align:center; margin-bottom:18px; font-size:.95rem;}
  .plans{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; align-items:stretch;}
  .plan{background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:20px; padding:24px 22px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); display:flex; flex-direction:column; transition:transform .3s ease;}
  .plan:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);}
  .plan h3{color:var(--emerald-2); font-size:1.15rem;}
  .plan .freq{opacity:.8; font-size:.9rem; margin-top:3px; font-weight:700; color:var(--gold-deep);}
  .plan .prices{margin:16px 0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:9px; flex:1;}
  .plan .prices div{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); padding-top:9px; font-size:.93rem;}
  .plan .prices div:first-child{border-top:none; padding-top:0;}
  .plan .prices b{color:var(--emerald-2); font-size:clamp(1rem,4.2vw,1.25rem); font-family:'El Messiri';}
  .plan .cta-btn{margin-top:6px; align-self:flex-start;}

  .arabic-program{margin-top:28px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; padding:30px 28px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr; gap:26px; align-items:center;}
  .arabic-program h3{color:var(--emerald-2); font-size:1.25rem;}
  .arabic-program .freq{color:var(--gold-deep); font-weight:700; font-size:.92rem; margin-top:6px;}
  .arabic-program .price{margin-top:12px; font-family:'El Messiri'; font-size:clamp(1.15rem,5vw,1.5rem); color:var(--emerald);}
  .arabic-program ul{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px 16px;}
  .arabic-program li{font-size:.9rem; opacity:.88; display:flex; gap:8px;}
  .arabic-program li:before{content:"✓"; color:var(--gold-deep); font-weight:700;}

  .final-cta{text-align:center;}
  .final-cta h2{color:var(--emerald); font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3.4vw,2rem);}
  .final-cta p{margin-top:12px; opacity:.8;}
  .final-cta .actions{margin-top:26px; display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:26px 0; text-align:center; opacity:.7; font-size:.88rem;}

  .wa-float{
    position:fixed; z-index:30; bottom:calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)); left:18px;
    background:#25D366; color:#fff; width:54px; height:54px; border-radius:50%;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 12px 26px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    text-decoration:none; transition:transform .25s ease;
  }
  .wa-float:hover{transform:scale(1.08);}
  .wa-float svg{width:28px; height:28px;}

  .offers-float{
    position:fixed; z-index:30; bottom:calc(88px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)); right:18px;
    background:var(--gold-deep); color:#fff; padding:13px 20px; border-radius:100px;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-family:'Tajawal'; font-weight:700; font-size:.92rem;
    text-decoration:none; box-shadow:0 12px 26px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    transition:transform .25s ease, padding .3s ease, font-size .3s ease;
  }
  .offers-float:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);}
  .offers-float .emoji{font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference){
    .offers-float{animation:offersPulse 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;}
  }
  @keyframes offersPulse{
    0%,100%{box-shadow:0 12px 26px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 0 0 rgba(169,130,63,.5);}
    50%{box-shadow:0 12px 26px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 0 9px rgba(169,130,63,0);}
  }
  .offers-float.compact{padding:12px; border-radius:50%; animation:none;}
  .offers-float.compact .label{display:none;}
  @media (max-width:820px){
    .offers-float{padding:10px 15px; font-size:.82rem; right:14px; bottom:calc(80px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));}
  }

  /* Tablet: 601px–1000px — own layout, not mobile's single column nor desktop's full columns */
  @media (max-width:1000px){
    .arabic-program{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .audience-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  }
  @media (min-width:601px) and (max-width:1000px){
    .grid3, .plans, .offers-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  }
  /* Phone: 600px and below — single column throughout */
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .grid3, .plans, .offers-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .rowlist{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .why-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .letter{margin:0 12px; padding:30px 20px;}
    .arabic-program ul{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .flex-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">ف</span><span class="brand-text">أكاديمية فيض</span></div>
    <a class="cta-btn" href="https://fayd-academy.fillout.com/start" target="_blank" rel="noopener">احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية</a>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="arch">
    <span class="blob b1"></span><span class="blob b2"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-frame"><svg viewBox="0 0 400 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4,92 L4,32 C4,8 396,8 396,32 L396,92" fill="none" stroke="#0d3d33" stroke-width="2"/></svg><div class="eyebrow">قرآن · تجويد · لغة عربية · علوم شرعية — لكل الأعمار</div></div>
    <h1>احفظ القرآن وتعلّم علومه من بيتك</h1>
    <p class="lead">حصص فردية مباشرة مع معلمين ومعلمات متخصصين، بمواعيد مرنة تناسبك وتناسب أسرتك.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="cta-btn accent" href="https://fayd-academy.fillout.com/start" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🎁 احجز حصتك التجريبية المجانية</a>
      <a class="cta-btn ghost" href="#plans">تعرّف على الباقات</a>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:16px; font-size:.85rem; opacity:.75;">متاح للطلاب من السعودية والإمارات والخليج وجميع أنحاء العالم</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="flex-time mini">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:26px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4.6vw,2.5rem); line-height:1.35;">⏰ وقتك لا يجب أن يكون عائقًا أمام التعلم</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-grid">
      <div class="flex-card">
        <p>هل ترغب في حفظ القرآن وتعلمه، لكن ضغط العمل والدوام يجعل من الصعب الالتزام بموعد ثابت؟</p>
        <p class="solution">في أكاديمية فيض نوفر مواعيد مرنة تناسب ظروفك، حتى تستطيع التعلم والاستمرار دون أن يتعارض ذلك مع عملك والتزاماتك اليومية.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-card">
        <p>وهل طفلك مشغول بالمدرسة والدروس والأنشطة اليومية؟</p>
        <p class="solution">نوفر أوقاتًا مرنة تناسب جدول الطفل والأسرة، لتكون حلقات القرآن والعلوم الشرعية جزءًا من يومه دون ضغط أو تعارض مع دراسته.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:20px;"><div class="tip">مرونة في المواعيد بما يناسب الطالب والأسرة</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="offers-teaser mini">
  <div class="wrap reveal" style="text-align:center;">
    <div class="teaser-card">
      <div class="teaser-title">🎁 عروض خاصة لفترة محدودة</div>
      <ul class="teaser-list">
        <li>خصم 20% للطالب الثاني من الإخوة أو الأصدقاء</li>
        <li>خصم 20% عند الاشتراك 3 أشهر</li>
        <li>شهر مجاني عند الاشتراك 6 أشهر</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta-btn accent" href="#offers">اعرف العرض واحجز الآن ←</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="offer">
